abstract: >
  BrainWaves is an easy-to-use platform for designing, running,
  and analyzing EEG experiments in the classroom. It supports
  visual event-related potential experiments and EEG acquisition
  from Muse and Neurosity devices.

keywords:
  - EEG
  - electroencephalography
  - neuroscience
  - education
  - event-related potentials
  - ERP
